age Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat13\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump\" id=\"6872872\">Sewage Submersible Pump</a><ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch\" id=\"6872928\">SS Submersible Sewage Pump with Float Switch</a></li>\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/submersible-sewage-pump-with-grinder\" id=\"6872929\">Submersible Sewage Pump with Grinder</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat14\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump\" id=\"6872880\">Self Suction Screw Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat15\"><a href=\"/submersible-solar-pump\" id=\"7719400\">Submersible Solar Pump</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"con_title\">Contact Us</div>\n<div class=\"contact_box\"><p>JD Frontier</p><p>ADD: City Saddar Road, Rawalpindi, Pakistan</p><p>TEL: <a href=\"tel:+92515553023\">051-5553023</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro_right\">\n<div class=\"pror_wrap\">\n<div class=\"pror_detail\">\n<div class=\"fl\"><div class=\"singglepic\"><img alt=\"JIADI Stainless Steel Self-Suction Screw Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/cast-iron-self-suction-screw-pump23527749537.jpg\"/></div><link href=\"/images/spic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/></div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">JIADI Stainless Steel Self-Suction Screw Pump</h1>\n<p>JIADI Stainless Steel Self-Suction Screw Pump.This Pump works on the land, don't support to use in water. JIADI pump Industry is a manufacturer and supplier of pumps in Wenling, Taizhou, Zhejiang.The company has been working on pump industry for about 30 years. We offering various performance type of pumps to meet customer's demand.</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"68262893\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><strong>JIADI Stainless Steel Self-Suction Screw Pump</strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><img src=\"/admin.seo.com.cn/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271326436792930.jpg\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">JIADI pump Industry is a manufacturer and supplier of pumps in Wenling, Taizhou, Zhejiang. Starting as a small operation, the company has been working on pump industry for about 30 years. We customize our offerings to fit the specific needs of our clients and sell stainless steel Self-Suction Screw Pump for customers' special needs.</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271326386960252.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image003(001).jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (Specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"180\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Product name</p></td><td width=\"384\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">SG series self-suction single screw pumps</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"180\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Type number</p></td><td width=\"384\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">SGD75040</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"180\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Application</p></td><td width=\"384\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">widely used in many fields</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"180\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Capacity</p></td><td width=\"384\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">1.6~2 m³/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"180\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Casing Material</p></td><td width=\"384\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Stainless steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"180\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Feature</p></td><td width=\"384\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">High efficiency, energy-saving, high suction height and easy operating</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"180\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">type</p></td><td width=\"384\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Horizontal single screw pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"180\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Voltage</p></td><td width=\"384\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">220-240V/ 380-420V</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"180\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Warranty</p></td><td width=\"384\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">One Year</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271328566991551.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271329018610609.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Production Application</strong></p><p>This series pump is suitable for water supply to households, high buildings, factories, mines and so on. If fitted a pressure switch to control the water level that can automatically supply water. This pump is an ideal tool to draw water for the modern families.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271331196011245.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Package and Shipping</strong></p><p><strong>Packaging Details:</strong></p><p>·Square carton (with cylinder or foam),</p><p>·Wooden box</p><p>·According to your requirement.</p><p>·By sea, by air and by express delivery</p><p><strong>Delivery Detail:</strong></p><p>·Depend on the pumps' order date.</p><p>·Usually about 20-30 days.</p><p><strong>Trade terms:</strong></p><p>·FOB,CIF,CFR (CNF),etc</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271331236943271.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Company Profile</strong></p><p>JIADI pump Industry was founded in 1998 by Mr. Chen, who is always interested in pumps and has been sophisticated in making pumps for many years. In JIADI, every employee attaches great Importance to the quality of the pump and the satisfaction of customers.  Our products have continuously received praise from our customers and now we desire to be known by more people and to serve customers from all over the world.</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271333485109315.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Why Choose Us</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271334237764475.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>8. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411154549302.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411169751193.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS </td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p>We are proud of those certificates which can prove the quality of our products and we also feel inspirited that we have made such pumps to offer convenience for customers.</p><p><strong>9. FAQ </strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: How about the delivery time?</strong></p><p>A: Normally, 20-30 days. But it depends on your order quantity.</p><p><strong>2. Q: Do you have Skype?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, plz add for further communicating.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Do you have quality control of pumpS?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, we attach great importance to quality control for EVERYY pump.</p><p><strong>4. Q: What kind of information I should offer so that you can recommend the suitable pump?</strong></p><p>A. Diameter for the borehole, pond or well .</p><p>B. Water flow per hour</p><p>C. lift from lowest water level to ground</p><p>D. Vertical height from tank (if any) to ground </p><p>E. Horizontal distance between borehole and tank</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: jiadi stainless steel self-suction screw pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/peripheral-submersible-pump/cast-iron-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Cast Iron Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/ss-submersible-peripheral-pump25185990378a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/peripheral-submersible-pump/cast-iron-submersible-pump\">Cast Iron Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/submersible-pressure-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Pressure Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-pressure-pump25494129035a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/submersible-pressure-pump\">Submersible Pressure Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/6-submersible-pump/6-submersible-impeller-pump/agricultural-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Agricultural Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/agricultural-submersible-pump40593228970a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/6-submersible-pump/6-submersible-impeller-pump/agricultural-submersible-pump\">Agricultural Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/stainless-steel-impeller-submersible-pump/6-stainless-steel-submersible-pump/6sp-stainless-steel-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"6SP Stainless Steel Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/6sp-stainless-steel-submersible-pump51061612838a77d.jpg?si